    "sentence_translations": [
      "Watching a Football Game",
      "",
      "Today there is a World Cup match between Germany and Argentina, ..",
      ".. so Little Le and Paul have been guarding the TV since early morning.",
      "But Little Le likes Germany and Paul is a fan of Argentina's team, so they fight without end from the start of the game.",
      "Paul shouts “Go Argentina! Go Argentina!” while watching the game.",
      "Little Le is not pleased and responds by shouting “Go Germany! Argentina sucks!”",
      "When Germany scores a goal, Little Le jumps up and yells “Goal! Goal! Germany is awesome!”",
      "",
      "Germany then went on to win the game with 1-0, and became the champions.",
      "Little Le was excited, but Paul was not happy.",
      "He said to Little Le: “It's because you said that Argentina sucks that they lost. It's all your fault!”"
    ]
